{"unit_id":"Wine-Red__dsh-codex-timeline#card-zh","repo":"Wine-Red/dsh-codex-timeline","commit":"71343f97437fd3b7f1c80f91bfdb589b9c2136fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Codex Timeline 是面向 DSH Web 的轮次导航增强插件。它在会话头部操作区接入搜索与收藏面板，并沿用官方轮次导航显示可定制的时间线。用户可以搜索当前会话的历史轮次、跳转到匹配内容、收藏常用轮次、预览轮次摘要与时间和 Token 指标，也可以从已完成轮次创建分支，并调整导航位置和间距。适合需要在长对话中定位内容、管理常用轮次或基于旧轮次继续探索的 DSH Web 用户。需要兼容版本的 DSH Web 宿主服务，不需要额外 API 密钥；偏好保存在 DSH profile 设置中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:879-1015","lib/client.js:1121-1148","lib/index.js:253-390","lib/index.js:665-741"]}
{"unit_id":"Wine-Red__dsh-codex-timeline#card-en","repo":"Wine-Red/dsh-codex-timeline","commit":"71343f97437fd3b7f1c80f91bfdb589b9c2136fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Codex Timeline enhances DSH Web turn navigation with session search, favorites, turn previews, branching, and layout controls. It helps users find and revisit useful turns in long conversations. It requires compatible DSH host services, but no API key; preferences are saved in profile settings.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:879-1015","lib/client.js:1121-1148","lib/index.js:253-390","lib/index.js:665-741"]}
